     are used to identify the parent.  The value of both members are offsets
     into the ssttrriinngg section which point to the start of a null-terminated
     string.  For more information on the encoding of strings, see the subsec‐
     tion on _S_t_r_i_n_g _I_d_e_n_t_i_f_i_e_r_s.  If the value of either is zero, then there
